// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// THE RIVALS — dhRivalDraw(g, C), C.kind: 'bathtub' #4 green · 'wheelbarrow' #5 orange · 'trolley' #0 cyan ·
//   'mower' #7 purple (short aliases: tub, barrow, cart, mow). Same view as the Poptart (view/yaw/elev/pxm/x/y/rot).
//   Drivers: a round body and a round helmet with a dark visor, in the number's colour, mitts on the controls.
