// ── THE LOCKS: built once per measure set. Head space (×r): y up, z forward, x her LEFT. ──
//   Each: { tier, az (root azimuth, 0 = front, + toward her left), len, out (angle from straight down, toward
//   outward), flick (extra outward curl at the tip), w, col (0/1), wave (its own S), seed }. The root height
