function dhLandmarkS(lm) { return dhSegS(lm.seg, lm.at); }

// ── _geo/episodes/ep03/blocks/dh_road.js
// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// DH ROAD · THE CHASE CAMERA — the signature view of the race (ROAD department).
//   The real course (dh_course.js) projected in perspective: the road is a ribbon of samples,
//   curves and hills are the course's own accumulated heading and height, and the ground
//   curves away as a small planet (every point drops by d² / 2R, so the horizon dips and bends
//   exactly where the road's far end sinks into it). Drawn far → near in COURSE order, so the
//   lower switchback legs, the brink of the Wall and the town below all occlude correctly.
//   Marker on paper: flat fills, ink edges that thicken as they approach; round things are
//   Mook's own helpers (mmTree, mmLampPost, mmGumball, mmMushroom) standing up as billboards,
//   houses and shops are real boxes whose facades run to the vanishing point.
