// ═══ THINGS: boxes (houses, shops, Tortimer's) with their gable ends in perspective, and cards ═══
//   A box: centre (s, off) of its road-facing wall's foot... b = { s0, s1 (along), o0, o1 (lateral, |o0| < |o1|),
//   zb, zt (walls), rh (gable roof, ridge along the road) or 0, colours }. Faces drawn back to front.
