// ── THE POOL, CUT AWAY (S11.04 · WS eye, slow motion: "Everybody dives into the empty pool"). The cartoon cross-section:
//    the deck on both sides, the bowl cut through (the soil round it, the far wall's inside with their names), the deep
//    end on the LEFT (they run in from the right, away from the camper falling behind them, and dive left). The house
//    next door stands on the right (S11.07 flattens it); the camper's fire lights the sky top-right.
//    S3_POOLSIDE gives the geometry the dives land on. o: { P (the light), glow (0..1: the camper's fire), t }
