// ── _geo/episodes/ep04/blocks/mm_chores4.js
// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// mm_chores4.js · EP4 · the Cloister steps on Mowing Day morning (🎬 Claude, 2026-10-07). Needs mm_cloister3.js.
//   e4OrphanDraw / e4Orphan : the orphans (🎬 extras: DOWNHILL's townsfolk shapes, in pyjamas, with dot faces)
