// mm_order5.js · EP5 · THE PAINTER'S ORDER, FROM FOOTPRINTS (🎬 Claude, 2026-10-08, after Mook's EP4 note: "some clipping
//   remains — layers not being on the right layer"). Needs mm_yard3.js (the yd camera: ydDepth, ydPt).
//   THE BUG: every set sorted its items by ONE point each (ydDepth(it.x, it.z) + a hand-tuned dz). A long thing (a counter,
//   a table, a fence, the pool's edge) has one depth at its middle and another at its ends, so with the camera at an angle
//   a kid standing in front of a counter's far end measures "farther" than the counter's middle and is painted under it.
//   THE FIX: every item carries its floor footprint (a circle or a box, metres) and a height. Two items whose pictures
//   overlap are ordered by geometry: the line that separates their footprints, and which side of it the camera stands on
//   (for things standing on the floor this is exact). The rest keep the old depth order.
