//   to follow than the game in the last episode"). Needs mm_core.js; the holograms ride on EP4's mm_game4.js.
//   e5Hud(g, t, o): THE RING COUNTER. Two rows of seven lights at the bottom of the frame for the whole game, each
//     identity read three ways (feedback_identity_and_colour: colour, glyph, word): FINLEY ▲ in Arch's green on the left,
//     the FHAT ● in the Rabbit's violet on the right. o = { on 0..1, fin (lit, 0..7, fractional while one goes out),
//     fhat, out: [{ who, i, u 0..1 }] (a light going dark: it flares, then dies), title ('FOR THE POOL') }
//   e5Rule(g, t, o): THE RULE CARD at the top of the frame in part 2: { n, text, k 0..1 (in/out) }
//   e5Rabbit(g, x, y, h, t, o): the Fhat's commander, a hologram rabbit (🎬): { on, talk, twitch, yaw (±1 facing) }
//   e5Jack(g, x, y, s, ang, o): a jackrabbit fighter glyph (light) · e5Burrow(g, x, y, rx, u): a hole opening in the light
