// mm_stow10.js · EP10 · 2 · STOWAWAY: the film layer for the B-plot's flight (🎬 Claude, 2026-10-13). Loads after mm_ship10.js,
//   mm_sky10.js, mm_field10.js, mm_film10.js.
//   📄 the script: "The hold: crates, three bunks, a round porthole. Finley on the floor." · "The cockpit: Pip at the wheel,
//   steering with one paw, calm. Murzim beside him." · "Into Sky Traffic: under a bus, between two lanes of flyers, a flyer
//   cuts across: the ship rolls right over it" · "Ali waves out of a porthole at a bus driver. The bus driver waves back." ·
//   "up through the clouds and out of the top" · "Orbit … Dwarf below, small and dense; both suns" · "Pip, the size of a
//   loaf of bread … The floor under him is dented." · "Something slides across the porthole".
//   e10Sky(g, t, cam, o)          the sky over Mowersville: the town on the ground, Sky Traffic, the cloud deck, o.items
//   e10Orbit(g, t, cam, o)        space round Dwarf: the stars, both suns, the globe, o.items (the ship)
//   e10In(g, t, cam, o)           INSIDE the ship (the hold and the cockpit) with the shot's cast; through its windows the world
//                                 outside, from the same lens: o.out = { ship (where the ship is), paint(g, cam, T) }
//   s10CockpitItems(B, o)         the cockpit: its floor, the helm perch, the console, Pip's wheel, the big round window
//   e10Window(so, u, side, draw)  someone seen from outside through one of the hull's portholes (drawn inside its disc)
//   e10Duffel(c, ax, T, d)        the duffel lying somewhere (d: m10DuffelDraw's own: zip, puff, puffLid …)
//   e10PuffAsleep(p, o)           Puff asleep (or floating, o.up), as a cast item
//   e10Dutch(g, a)                the frame turned by a about its middle (the lens rolling with the ship), scaled to cover
//   The ship's frame: u along it (+ the nose), v up, r its right (s10W). Inside shots use the ship at rest at the origin, nose
