//   the Cloister EP6's building and dome, Town Hall a black block on the square. Mount Clipping is EP4's heap of cut grass;
//   Big Hill a real hill. Trees are round (lit and shaded), the Dogwoods a wood of blossoming dogwoods. Shadows lie on the
