// ═══ THE GROUND TEXTURE: the town's ground, baked once in WORLD METRES (T10.tex: 3.4 px a metre): the lawn, the Dogwoods,
//   every lot's yard, the streets and their turning circles, the drives and paths, the square, the shadows, the slopes' light ═══
