// ── (EP11) THE HAND SOLVER, made safe (found on the props sheet: Bronconius's hands 20 cm off the cooler's handles) ──
//   EP10's warm start (mm_prod10.js) starts each hand from where it ended the frame before, and stops when a round stops
//   closing the gap. After a cut (or on a check sheet) "the frame before" is another shot's arm: from there, or from the
