// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// ROSE'S SUNGLASSES (📄 "Rose with a tackle box, sunglasses up on her head" · "Rose pushes her sunglasses up and looks into
//   the water"). v1 (two round lenses and a bridge) read strange: 🗣 2026-10-14 "shades look stange and need a re dsign that
//   suits roses character better". v2, two to choose from (🎬); ✅ 🗣 7:22 pm "i like the cat eye ones": 'cat' is hers (the default):
//    · 'shield' (my pick): SPORT WRAPAROUNDS. One curved mirrored lens wrapping round the front of her head over both of her
//      side-set eyes (a gecko's eyes are on the sides: a wrap is what would actually cover them), teal into violet into pink
