// ═══ ROSE AND GIL RUN ALONG THE SHORE, THROUGH THE REEDS; THEY CRASH OUT OF THEM ═══
//   A run of their own (EP4's walk has no Rose or Gil): per step, a foot planted on the ground for a third of it (fixed in the
//   world while the body goes over it), then a swing with a kick-up behind; between steps both feet are off (a run's flight);
//   the body lowest at mid-step, highest in the flight; leaning into it; the arms pumping against the legs. Rose: 32 cm steps.
//   Gil (his legs are 8 cm): a scurry, short quick steps, his tail streaming behind.
//   The reeds part as they go through (each clump pushed aside by whoever passes it, sprung back after with a wobble), and where
//   they come out of the reeds into the open, the reeds burst: leaves and cattail fluff flying.
const SF11_RUN = { rose: { step: 0.32, w: 0.34, lift: 0.17, bob: 0.035, lean: 0.3, arm: 0.55 }, gil: { step: 0.2, w: 0.3, lift: 0.16, bob: 0.03, lean: 0.24, arm: 0.6 } };
