//   🎬 Six fish come in from the lake to his boot, nose in, hanging there; one nibbles under the bobber (dip, dip, under). His rod
//   (upside down, EP11-PROPS) FLICKS: a sleeper's twitch, its tip whipping up out of the water and round toward the dock, the
