//     'alley'), lights 0..1 (the bulbs round the ceiling running), lava 0..1, ready 0..1 (the light, blinking), glove 0..1 (open),
//     cards 0..1 (the first editions' hum glow), beads (x where someone parts them, or null), levers: { sail 0..1, anchor 0..1 or
//     'off' }, wheel (rad, its turn), shake (0..1 the engine running), cast: items in ROOM metres (from c12Place) } → C (the lens)
