//   shop: bzScene, BZ, BZ_C, bzWall …) and mm_yard3.js (yd*). Every global starts s14 / S14. Never random(): mmH2 only.
//   The shop's own metres (EP4): x across (+x the counter's side), z from the street door (z −5.5) to the back room (z 2.4 … 8.4).
